# Use a local registry for dependencies to simplify registry development.
# To enable in module repo of tx-kit-wsp:
# - macOS/Linux: ln -s ../tx-kit-registry local-registry
# - Windows: mklink /D local-registry ..\tx-kit-registry
# This config can be copied or symlinked to repo:
# - macOS/Linux: ln -s uni/user.pre.bazelrc user.pre.bazelrc
# - Windows: mklink user.pre.bazelrc uni\user.pre.bazelrc
common --registry=file:///%workspace%/local-registry
